   "body": "The limited-time offer launched in May: a beef stack, then a sauce layer. Two prep steps.\n\nRevenue is on `COMBO_REVENUE_DAILY` (`is_lto`). How much of a store's drive-thru trade it makes up is `double_stack_transactions` over `dt_transactions` on `DAILY_SALES_FACT`.",
