   "body": "# Care recovery policy\n\nFor a wait-time complaint:\n\n1. Apologise without qualification.\n2. Give the real reason if there is a known one.\n3. Offer a $5 recovery voucher when the store is flagged as over benchmark.\n4. Say what is being done. Give a date only if operations has confirmed one.\n\nEscalate a store to operations when it draws four or more wait-time complaints in a week, or is more than 30 seconds over benchmark. Never blame the store team.",
